    "code": "Y",
    "quote": "to ensure the fairness of the comparison, all experiments are run ten times in the following experiments. When it comes to accuracy comparisons, the values presented are the average of the ten run results.",
    "location": "p.6",
    "reason": "论文明确说明所有实验运行10次，报告的是10次结果的平均值，属于明确写了选模规则（报告平均值），填Y。"
